{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40128,"sections":[{"id":"script-20128","name":"原始脚本 20128","scripts":[20128],"start":0,"count":21}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:1","scriptId":20128,"text":"由于有了妮科尔的帮助，我们从地面和空中对战车兽进行了火力打击，很快便消灭了那些战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:2","scriptId":20128,"text":"妮科尔缓缓地降落了下来，以半浮空的姿态浮现在众人面前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:3","scriptId":20128,"text":"“妮科尔，真是谢谢你了，没有你从后方给予战车兽打击的话，我们难以如此轻松的获得胜利。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":815,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:4","scriptId":20128,"text":"“那个……这是我应该做的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":815,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":742,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:5","scriptId":20128,"text":"“好了好了，长官不要抓着人家的手不放啦！这样很没礼貌耶。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":742,"right":815,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:6","scriptId":20128,"text":"“长官真是出击神速，刚见面就牵手～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":742,"right":582,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:7","scriptId":20128,"text":"“啊！不好意思……不自觉就……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:8","scriptId":20128,"text":"我立刻松开了抓住妮科尔的手。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":815,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:9","scriptId":20128,"text":"“没关系……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":815,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:10","scriptId":20128,"text":"“我想这都是波西娅的杰作吧……能飞行的钢舞姬呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":815,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:11","scriptId":20128,"text":"“是啊！这么方便的舞装！我也要我也要！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:12","scriptId":20128,"text":"“等会儿可以去问问波西娅具体情况……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:13","scriptId":20128,"text":"“我身上的舞装目前还处于测试阶段。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:14","scriptId":20128,"text":"“诶？真可惜……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":740,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:15","scriptId":20128,"text":"“并且刚才那场战斗我的核心好像出现了一点问题，我现在准备回波西娅博士那里进行报告。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":740,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:16","scriptId":20128,"text":"“那你快去吧，顺便把通信器给波西娅……让她不要再弄错了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:17","scriptId":20128,"text":"“恩。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:18","scriptId":20128,"text":"说完，妮科尔纵身一跃，在空中划出一道白色的航迹云，一眨眼功夫就消失在了众人的视线之中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":4,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:19","scriptId":20128,"text":"“真好啊……希望有朝一日我也能像她那样飞翔……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":740,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:20","scriptId":20128,"text":"“好了好了，度假村这边的事情收拾完了，我们现在回伊诺娜那边吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20128:20128:21","scriptId":20128,"text":"在这个时候，我们并不知道伊诺娜那边已经发生了相当恐怖的事情……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
